@startuml
title POST /api/v1/review/course/{course_id} - Create Review Flow

start

:Client sends POST /api/v1/review/course/{course_id} request;

note right
Optional Query Parameters (or Body Parameters):
- Rating: int
- ReviewText: string
end note

:JWT Authentication Middleware validates access token;

if (JWT token valid?) then (Yes)

    :Request reaches ReviewController;

    :Controller validates parameters;

    if (Validation failed?) then (Yes)
        :Return 400 Bad Request;
        stop
    endif

    :Controller forwards request to Mediator;

    :Mediator sends request to Repository/Handler layer;

    :Handler calls CourseRepository to check course existence;

    if (Course exists?) then (Yes)
        :Handler calls EnrollmentRepository to check enrollment;
        if (User enrolled?) then (Yes)
            :Handler calls ReviewRepository to check for existing review;
            if (Review already exists?) then (Yes)
                :Return 409 Conflict;
            else (No)
                :Handler calls ReviewRepository to save review;
                :Map entity to DTO;
                :Return 200 OK;
            endif
        else (No)
            :Return 400 Bad Request;
        endif
    else (No)
        :Return 404 Not Found;
    endif

else (No)

    :Return 401 Unauthorized;

endif

stop

@enduml
